@startuml 自习任务用况图
' 赵冠钧 · 第二阶段分析 · 用况图
' 表达用户目标：自习任务界面与位置采集，不把按钮画成用况
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam arrowColor #5B6B7C
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F5F8FB
  BorderColor #6F97B8
  FontColor #1F2A37
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #B9C7D4
  FontColor #1F2A37
}
left to right direction

actor 玩家 as Player
actor "手机定位服务" as Loc

rectangle "PKMon 自习任务界面与位置采集" {
  usecase "UC-S1\n开始自习任务" as S1
  usecase "UC-S2\n采集并上传位置样本" as S2
  usecase "UC-S3\n查看任务状态" as S3
  usecase "UC-S4\n暂停与恢复感知" as S4
  usecase "UC-S5\n结束任务" as S5
  usecase "UC-S6\n跳转答题捕获" as S6
}

Player --> S1
Player --> S3
Player --> S5
Player --> S6
Player --> S2
Player --> S4
Loc --> S2 : 提供经纬度/精度/时刻\n不决定奖励
S1 ..> S2 : include
S2 ..> S3 : 每次响应刷新展示
S2 ..> S4 : 离开区域或无合格信号
S6 ..> S3 : 需 status=TRIGGERED\n且存在 spawnId
note right of S6
  捕获结算不在本边界内
  见孙虹毅答题捕获用况
end note
@enduml
